  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "In triangle \\(ABC,\\) point \\(F\\) divides side \\(AC\\) in the ratio \\(1:2.\\) Let \\(E\\) be the point where side \\(BC\\) meets \\(AG,\\) where \\(G\\) is the midpoint of \\(BF.\\) Then \\(E\\) divides \\(BC\\) in the ratio:",
